{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function rawHotkeyToParsedHotkey(raw, platform?): ParsedHotkey;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/parse.ts#L99","children":[{"type":"text","value":"parse.ts:99"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Converts a RawHotkey object to a ParsedHotkey.\nOptional modifier booleans default to false; modifiers array is derived from them.\nWhen "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mod"},{"type":"text","value":" is true, it is resolved to Control or Meta based on platform."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"raw","children":[{"type":"text","value":"raw"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/RawHotkey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RawHotkey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The raw hotkey object"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"platform","children":[{"type":"text","value":"platform?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"mac\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"windows\""},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"linux\""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The target platform for resolving 'Mod' (defaults to auto-detection)"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ParsedHotkey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ParsedHotkey"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A ParsedHotkey suitable for matching and formatting"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"rawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'Escape' })\n// { key: 'Escape', ctrl: false, shift: false, alt: false, meta: false, modifiers: [] }\n\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'S', mod: true }, 'mac')\n// { key: 'S', ctrl: false, shift: false, alt: false, meta: true, modifiers: ['Meta'] }\n\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'S', mod: true, shift: true }, 'windows')\n// { key: 'S', ctrl: true, shift: true, alt: false, meta: false, modifiers: ['Control', 'Shift'] }","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"raw","text":"raw","level":3},{"id":"platform","text":"platform?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction rawHotkeyToParsedHotkey(raw, platform?): ParsedHotkey;\n```\n\nDefined in: [parse.ts:99](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/parse.ts#L99)\n\nConverts a RawHotkey object to a ParsedHotkey.\nOptional modifier booleans default to false; modifiers array is derived from them.\nWhen `mod` is true, it is resolved to Control or Meta based on platform.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### raw\n\n[`RawHotkey`](../type-aliases/RawHotkey.md)\n\nThe raw hotkey object\n\n### platform?\n\n`\"mac\"` \\| `\"windows\"` \\| `\"linux\"`\n\nThe target platform for resolving 'Mod' (defaults to auto-detection)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ParsedHotkey`](../type-aliases/ParsedHotkey.md)\n\nA ParsedHotkey suitable for matching and formatting\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'Escape' })\n// { key: 'Escape', ctrl: false, shift: false, alt: false, meta: false, modifiers: [] }\n\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'S', mod: true }, 'mac')\n// { key: 'S', ctrl: false, shift: false, alt: false, meta: true, modifiers: ['Meta'] }\n\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'S', mod: true, shift: true }, 'windows')\n// { key: 'S', ctrl: true, shift: true, alt: false, meta: false, modifiers: ['Control', 'Shift'] }\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: rawHotkeyToParsedHotkey\ntitle: rawHotkeyToParsedHotkey\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction rawHotkeyToParsedHotkey(raw, platform?): ParsedHotkey;\n```\n\nDefined in: [parse.ts:99](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/parse.ts#L99)\n\nConverts a RawHotkey object to a ParsedHotkey.\nOptional modifier booleans default to false; modifiers array is derived from them.\nWhen `mod` is true, it is resolved to Control or Meta based on platform.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### raw\n\n[`RawHotkey`](../type-aliases/RawHotkey.md)\n\nThe raw hotkey object\n\n### platform?\n\n`\"mac\"` \\| `\"windows\"` \\| `\"linux\"`\n\nThe target platform for resolving 'Mod' (defaults to auto-detection)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`ParsedHotkey`](../type-aliases/ParsedHotkey.md)\n\nA ParsedHotkey suitable for matching and formatting\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'Escape' })\n// { key: 'Escape', ctrl: false, shift: false, alt: false, meta: false, modifiers: [] }\n\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'S', mod: true }, 'mac')\n// { key: 'S', ctrl: false, shift: false, alt: false, meta: true, modifiers: ['Meta'] }\n\nrawHotkeyToParsedHotkey({ key: 'S', mod: true, shift: true }, 'windows')\n// { key: 'S', ctrl: true, shift: true, alt: false, meta: false, modifiers: ['Control', 'Shift'] }\n```\n"}
